 "title": "Atlantic City's Secret Tunnel",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🚗",
 "sentences": [
  "Meet the 2.37-mile highway known simply as the Tunnel.",
  "It extends the Atlantic City Expressway to Route 87.",
  "Proposals for this connector road actually date back to 1964.",
  "Planning finally began in 1995 after businessman Steve Wynn proposed a casino.",
  "Governor Christine Todd Whitman and Mayor Jim Whelan supported the project.",
  "Competing casino owner Donald Trump even filed lawsuits to prevent its construction."
